cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or ontology, please cite the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation) and, optionally, this repository."
title: "RAMP: Robotic Additive Manufacturing Planned-toolpath ontology and population pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A minimal OWL ontology and deterministic population pipeline that represent
  planned 6-DOF robotic additive-manufacturing toolpaths as a semantically
  enriched knowledge graph, enabling a-priori (design-stage) identification of
  trajectory-fidelity risks via SPARQL competency questions, with an RSI-telemetry
  corroboration lane.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
